{"title": "Painted Skull", "pageid": 34567, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Painted_Skull", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Skull_B_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Skull_B_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_B_Icon.webp, /w/images/3/36/Skull_B_Icon.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Painted Skull image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Skull_B_Icon.webp/300px-Skull_B_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Skull_B_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Painted Skull</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> Item. Primarily of use for bartering or sale to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a>.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zara\" title=\"Zara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Zara.png/25px-Portrait_Zara.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Zara.png/38px-Portrait_Zara.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Zara.png/50px-Portrait_Zara.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zara's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Portrait_Zara.png/25px-Portrait_Zara.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Portrait_Zara.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zara\" title=\"Zara\">Zara's</a> tent at the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;49&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-73</span></li>\n<li>Inside the tent and on a shelf next to the tent</li>\n<li>Around the back of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>When the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_Dribbles_the_Clown\" title=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_Dribbles_the_Clown\" title=\"Find Dribbles the Clown\">Find Dribbles the Clown</a> is completed, all painted skulls vanish with the Circus after the next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 162px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 160px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Painted_Skull_A_Ingame_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Ingame model of the first painted skull variant.\"><picture><img alt=\"Ingame model of the first painted skull variant.\" src=\"/w/images/2/25/Painted_Skull_A_Ingame_Model.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Painted_Skull_A_Ingame_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ingame model of the first painted skull variant.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 162px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 160px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Painted_Skull_B_Ingame_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Ingame model of the second painted skull variant\"><picture><img alt=\"Ingame model of the second painted skull variant\" src=\"/w/images/b/b4/Painted_Skull_B_Ingame_Model.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Painted_Skull_B_Ingame_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Ingame model of the second painted skull variant</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715051830\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1542/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13673/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4393/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1518/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 881270/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   29.530      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   29.530      1 -total\n 36.58%   10.802      7 Template:Icon_text\n 26.70%    7.886     14 Template:Trim\n 25.91%    7.651      4 Template:Icon_link\n 21.13%    6.240      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.38%    3.656      7 Template:Ifempty\n 